@startuml
!include _style.iuml
skinparam dpi 96
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam ArrowFontSize 15
skinparam ClassAttributeFontSize 15
skinparam NoteFontSize 16
skinparam LegendFontSize 14
hide footbox
autonumber
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 400
skinparam sequenceMessageSpan true
skinparam sequence {
  MessageSpacing 2
  GroupBorderThickness 1
}
title Sequence view · UC-4 fences a stale Claim before any mutation\nAs built at 76282d3
' Evidence: https://github.com/Collaboration95/dc2/blob/76282d3/processing/messaging.py#L405
' Evidence: https://github.com/Collaboration95/dc2/blob/76282d3/processing/lifecycle.py#L184
' Evidence: https://github.com/Collaboration95/dc2/blob/76282d3/processing/lifecycle.py#L28
' Evidence: https://github.com/Collaboration95/dc2/blob/76282d3/media/messaging.py#L16
' Evidence: https://github.com/Collaboration95/dc2/blob/76282d3/delivery/sql.py#L18
' Evidence: https://github.com/Collaboration95/dc2/blob/76282d3/media/projections.py#L36
' Evidence: https://github.com/Collaboration95/dc2/blob/76282d3/media/projections.py#L69
skinparam ArrowFontSize 17
skinparam defaultFontSize 18
skinparam NoteFontSize 16
skinparam LegendFontSize 16
skinparam maxMessageSize 310
participant "worker.sqs\n«module»" as W $PROC
participant "messaging\n«module»" as M $PROC
participant "lifecycle\n«module»" as L $PROC
participant "s: AsyncSession" as DB $INFRA
note over W,DB : Old Claim(A1,T1); A2 is current; outputs pass validation first.
activate W
W -> M : finish(f,work,outputs=outputs)
activate M
M -> L : finish(f,work,outputs=outputs,\nerror=None,on_change=emit_state)
activate L
group Processing stale-finish transaction
 L -> DB : scalar(Job query WITH FOR UPDATE) [lock_pair]
 DB --> L : job: Job (current_attempt_id=A2)
 L -> L : db_now(s); live(None,T1,now)
 note right of L : lock_pair returns None; live returns False.
end
L --> M : False
 deactivate L
M --> W : False
 deactivate M
 deactivate W
legend bottom
Claim is data passed by worker.sqs, not a worker object or a method owner.
Filled arrows = awaited calls; dashed = replies. No result outbox is staged on this path.
Delayed result messages face a separate Media projection fence (W3-13a).
endlegend

@enduml
